          "title": "The HeartBeat APT Campaign",
          "publisher": "Trend Micro"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Operation Bitter Biscuit (THAAD Targeting)",
      "year_published": "2017",
      "description": "Following South Korea's deployment of the U.S. THAAD missile defense system, FireEye attributed a surge of cyberattacks on South Korean defense and government entities to Tonto Team. FireEye described the group as \"tied to China's military and based out of Shenyang.\" The attacks aligned with broader Chinese opposition to THAAD.\n",
      "target_sectors": [
        "government",
