          "publisher": "The Wall Street Journal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Eastern Europe Expansion (Bisonal/ShadowPad)",
      "year_published": "2020",
      "description": "Kaspersky documented Tonto Team's expansion into Eastern European financial and military targets, identifying 300+ Bisonal samples between March 2019 and April 2020. The group also deployed ShadowPad for the first time, indicating access to more sophisticated shared Chinese APT tooling.\n",
