      "year_published": "2022",
      "description": "Coinciding with Russia's invasion of Ukraine, Tonto Team increased espionage operations against Russian government agencies and scientific institutions. Royal Road RTF lures disguised as government security advisories delivered Bisonal payloads. SentinelOne noted a potential Chinese intelligence increase in collection requirements against Russia amid shifting geopolitical dynamics.\n",
