    {
      "name": "TAG-74 South Korea Multi-Year Campaign",
      "year_published": "2023",
      "description": "Recorded Future documented a sustained campaign targeting South Korean academic, political, and government organizations. The group used CHM file lures to deploy a custom ReVBShell variant followed by Bisonal. Recorded Future assessed the campaign aligns with \"the likely operational purview of the Northern Theater Command.\"\n",
